      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In the present study the influences of type and duration of complaints, findings, therapeutic method, duration of therapy and patient cooperation on the prognosis of temporo-mandibular joint disorders were analyzed. The elimination of occlusal interferences may be regarded as causal therapy in the large majority of temporo-mandibular joint disorders. In these cases a very good and long-term rate of success may be achieved by the method of selectively grinding-in the teeth according to A. Lauritzen."},
